   "text": "Romans: *the vomitorium myth.*",
   "frames": 75
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "text": "The story says Romans had a room for *throwing up.*",
   "frames": 130
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "text": "So they could eat *even more.*",
