  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "text": "But a vomitorium was a *corridor.*",
   "frames": 98
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "text": "In an amphitheatre or a *stadium.*",
   "frames": 95
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "text": "The word means a place that *spews out.*",
   "frames": 102
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "text": "It spewed out *crowds,* not dinner.",
   "frames": 91
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "text": "The Colosseum had *dozens* of them.",
   "frames": 99
